hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15741","Mu'awiyah ibn Hisham narrated to us, he said: Sufyan narrated to us, from Abu Ali al-Sayqal, from Qutham ibn Tammam, or Tammam ibn Qutham, from his father, he said: We came to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he said: What is with you that you come to me with yellow teeth, not using the siwak? Were it not that I would burden my Ummah, I would have obligated the siwak upon them as I obligated ablution upon them."
